{"report_id":"R0063","study_id":"S017","title":"A cognitive synergetic hierarchical framework for UAV swarm combat via speculative inference and role-decoupled reinforcement learning","authors":"Wang, Lixa (60732360800); Liu, Yunqing (60503997200); Guo, Linyang (57195037026); Zhang, Ran (60732570300); Cui, Yu (60732708000); Cui, Yihan (60732360900); Xu, Chunlin (60732361000)","year":2026,"venue":"Frontiers in Neurorobotics","doi":"10.3389/fnbot.2026.1799054","pdf_path":"restart_2026_11_26/fulltext_retrieval/pdf/R0063.pdf","fields":{"identity":[{"subtopic":"bibliographic_identity","status":"OBSERVED","finding":"Original Research article in Frontiers in Neurorobotics, Vol. 20, 1799054, published 19 May 2026.","page":1,"locator":"Header, p. 1","excerpt":"PUBLISHED 19 May 2026 ... Front. Neurorobot. 20:1799054. doi: 10.3389/fnbot.2026.1799054"}],"uav_architecture_role_and_topology":[{"subtopic":"brain_torso_and_swarm_roles","status":"OBSERVED","finding":"Hierarchical Brain-Torso architecture over a Relative Pose Graph (RPG) in simulated aerial confrontation scenarios (1v1, 2v2, 4v4, 6v6, 8v8) with heterogeneous roles (scout, attacker, decoy/jammer) and sequential intention propagation (SIP).","page":11,"locator":"Section 5.1.2 and Table 2, pp. 11-12","excerpt":"This 6v6 fight includes attackers, scouts, and jammers."}],"inference_model_task_and_dataset":[{"subtopic":"llm_and_marl_models","status":"OBSERVED","finding":"Strategic Brain pairs DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Llama-70B (4-bit AWQ on ground/cloud workstation) with DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B (INT4 on edge Jetson AGX Orin) via speculative decoding at 5 Hz; Tactical Torso uses 3x256 MLP Actor and 2-layer 4-head GAT Critic at 50 Hz in JSBSim 6-DOF simulation.","page":11,"locator":"Section 5.1.1 and Table 3, pp. 11, 13","excerpt":"Running the DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Llama-70B model required us to use 4-bit AWQ quantization. On the other end, the Tactical Execution Layer (Torso) lived on an NVIDIA Jetson AGX Orin (64GB). This edg